    <!-- About / privacy -->
    <string name="about_title">About &amp; data sources</string>
    <string name="about_body">Woozy %1$s\n\nMap data © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). Vector tiles by OpenFreeMap, schema © OpenMapTiles. Search by Photon (komoot), based on OpenStreetMap.\n\nThe public OpenFreeMap and Photon servers are used for development. Production use should run its own tile and geocoding servers or a commercial plan.</string>
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">• Location is only read while Woozy is open on screen.\n• No location history is stored. Only reports you create and destinations you pick are saved, on this device.\n• Search queries are sent to the geocoding server together with your approximate position to rank nearby results.\n• Map tiles are downloaded from the tile server; the request reveals which area you are viewing.\n• Nothing is uploaded to a Woozy server: no backend is configured in this build.</string>
